{% comment %}
  BMP platform-instrumentation marker — FROZEN API.

  Emits a hidden, inert per-route ownership marker that external BuildMyPodAI
  platform scripts/analytics query to assert template ownership per route. The
  emitted class name and data-* attribute names are a FROZEN contract shared
  across customer-store themes — DO NOT rename them. Restored verbatim from the
  v1 production theme (bmp-v1-0-11/snippets/buildmypodai-layout-hook.liquid):
  same page-fallback chain (page | default: template | default: section.id) and
  ambient section.id, so the emitted DOM is byte-identical to what the platform
  already consumes. Hidden element avoids layout shifts.

  The filename carries the bmp- prefix for the BMP naming convention; the
  rendered class/attributes are the frozen API and are intentionally NOT prefixed.

  @param {string} [page] - Route identifier (e.g. 'page', 'collection-list',
    'search', 'password', 'article', 'blog', '404'). Falls back to template,
    then the owning section id.
{% endcomment %}
{% assign buildmypodai_page = page | default: template | default: section.id %}
<div
  class="buildmypodai-layout-hook"
  data-buildmypodai-page="{{ buildmypodai_page }}"
  data-buildmypodai-section="{{ section.id }}"
  hidden
></div>
